WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.980
- Let's play a game, all right?

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:02.813
On the count of three,

00:00:02.813 --> 00:00:04.185
name your favorite Supreme Court justice.

00:00:04.185 --> 00:00:05.550
Don't even think about it.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.900
One, two, three,

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.450
- [Both] Oliver Wendell Holmes.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.070
- Favorite article of clothing,

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.180
that's also a TV show.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.740
- [Both] Suits.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:15.420
- If you weren't a lawyer,
what would you do for a living?

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.250
- [Both] Professional bowler slash cowboy.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.083
- What?!

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:19.170
- Did we just become best friends?

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.370
- Yep.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.120
- Wanna go do karate in the garage?

00:00:24.030 --> 00:00:26.613
(upbeat music)

